Orpheus
=======

Orpheus is a modified version of JellyBox ("JellyBoxPlayer"), a music player
for Jellyfin, Emby and Navidrome.

  Original work:  JellyBox, https://github.com/avdept/JellyBoxPlayer
                  Copyright (C) ProdigyTech Inc. / Alex Sinelnikov and
                  contributors
  This fork:      https://github.com/imprudent-coding/Orpheus

Both the original work and this fork are licensed under the GNU Affero
General Public License, version 3 (see LICENSE). The copyright notices of the
original work are kept intact. The source code of this modified version,
including every change listed below, is available at the fork's URL above.

This fork is not affiliated with or endorsed by the JellyBox developers.
"JellyBox" is used here only to identify the original work.

Summary of changes in this fork
-------------------------------

- Renamed to "Orpheus". The application/bundle ID on every platform is
  com.github.imprudentcoding.orpheus (iOS widget extension:
  com.github.imprudentcoding.orpheus.NowPlayingWidget), so Orpheus installs
  side by side with JellyBox. The Dart package name (jplayer), the Android
  Kotlin namespace and internal class names are unchanged.
- Support links point at the fork's issue tracker instead of the JellyBox
  developer's email and Discord.
